{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\" datamodel=\"ecmascript\" initial=\"a\">\n  <state id=\"a\">\n    <onentry>\n      <script src=\" \"/>\n    </onentry>\n    <transition event=\"go\" target=\"done\"/>\n  </state>\n  <final id=\"done\"/>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml051-script-src-empty.scx"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":1,"notes":0,"total":1,"warnings":0},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml051-script-src-empty.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":21,"endLine":4,"startColumn":20,"startLine":4}}}],"message":{"markdown":"`<script src>` does not name a fetchable script\n\n**Note:** SCXML 1.0 §5.8: if the script specified by `src` cannot be downloaded at document load time, the document is rejected\n\n**Help:** set `src` to the URI of a Wasm script component or a script in the data model's language (non-empty, without control characters, at most 16384 bytes), or remove `src` and inline the script\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §5.8 <script>","text":"`<script src>` does not name a fetchable script"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":148,"start":147},"category":"semantic"},"ruleId":"SCXML051"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"an empty, whitespace-only, control-character, or over-long `src` can never be fetched, and SCXML 1.0 §5.8 rejects a document whose script cannot be downloaded at load"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: set `src` to the URI of a Wasm script component or a script in the data model's language, or remove `src` and inline the script.\n\nSpecification: SCXML 1.0 §5.8 <script>\n\nRun `scx --explain SCXML051` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/#script","id":"SCXML051","name":"SCXML051","properties":{"category":"semantic"},"shortDescription":{"text":"a `<script src>` does not name a fetchable script"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}